    "Motion index = fraction of arena pixels changing between consecutive 10 Hz frames, normalized to the median mouse body area. Freezing = motion below threshold for at least the minimum bout duration. Validate the threshold against hand-scored clips." : {
      "comment" : "Used in AssayCatalog",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运动指数 = 相邻 10 Hz 帧间发生变化的场地像素比例，并以小鼠身体面积中位数归一化。僵直 = 运动低于阈值且持续时间不短于最短发作时长。请用人工评分的片段验证阈值。"
