    "Trial-by-trial choices and rewards. Win-stay = P(repeat | rewarded); lose-shift = P(switch | unrewarded). Q-learning (α, β) fitted by maximum likelihood with a softmax choice rule." : {
      "comment" : "Used in AssayCatalog",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "逐试次的选择与奖赏。赢-留 = P(重复 | 获奖)；输-换 = P(切换 | 未获奖)。Q 学习参数（α, β）采用 softmax 选择规则以最大似然拟合。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
